{NTE_EVENT_LABEL} · Exhibitor confirmation

Your complimentary space is confirmed.

{NTE_ORGANISATION} has been allocated a complimentary exhibition space at {NTE_EVENT_LABEL}.

{!IF(ISBLANK(Contact.FirstName),"Hello,","Hi ")}{!Contact.FirstName}{!IF(ISBLANK(Contact.FirstName),"",",")}

We are delighted to confirm your complimentary place at {NTE_EVENT_LABEL}.

Your complimentary allocation

{NTE_PAYMENT_NOTE}

Final event details will be sent approximately two weeks before the event. If you have any questions, please do feel free to get in touch.

Should you require any printing, you may be interested in the services our Livery Bay (https://www.missionmotorsport.org/livery) has to offer.

Staff details and event preparation

Use your booking reference to provide the final staff names. You can also request additional staff places as separately invoiced top-ups if required.

Please upload your latest company logo for inclusion in the National Transition Event website logo montage. We request this from all exhibitors, as branding is often updated or refreshed.

